---
import InfoPage from "../components/InfoPage.astro";
---

<InfoPage title="Privacy policy">
  <p>This is a Phase 1 placeholder. The current site does not persist request fields, create accounts, accept payments, or accept reference uploads.</p>
  <h2>Planned privacy controls</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Private, access-controlled reference-image storage.</li>
    <li>Clear retention and deletion schedules for requests and reference files.</li>
    <li>Customer access to their own request information only.</li>
    <li>No payment card data stored by the studio.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>A complete privacy notice will be published before real request intake opens.</p>
</InfoPage>
